# What the dependences of this file have to come out as.
#
# The anti-dependence from the read of idx[0] to the write of lo at the
# element that shares its bytes.  Matched by shape rather than by index:
# the index moves with the size of the form and the iterator's name with
# the options ppcg was given, while the claim moves with neither.
dep_false *: \{ S_1\[\] -> S_2\[[a-z_0-9]+\] : [a-z_0-9]+ = [0-9]+ \}
